        "content_type": "text/html",
        "body": "SAP Communication <table cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" border=\"0\" align=\"center\"> <tbody> <tr> <td valign=\"top\" align=\"left\" style=\"width:600px;\"> <table cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" border=\"0\" bgcolor=\"#000000\" align=\"center\" style=\"width:600px;\"> <tbody> <tr> <td valign=\"Right\" align=\"center\"> </td> </tr> <tr> <td> <table cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" border=\"0\" align=\"center\" style=\"width:550px;\"><tbody><tr>\n<td valign=\"middle\" align=\"left\" style=\"width:550px;\"> </td>\n<td valign=\"middle\" align=\"right\"><a href=\"https://www.sap.com\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer noopener\" title=\"https://www.sap.com\" target=\"_blank\"></a></td>\n</tr></tbody></table> </td> </tr> </tbody> </table> <table cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" border=\"0\" align=\"center\" style=\"width:600px;\"> <tbody> <tr> <td style=\"width:600px;\" valign=\"top\" align=\"center\"> <p> </p>\n</td> </tr> <tr> <td valign=\"top\" align=\"left\" style=\"width:600px;\"> <table cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" border=\"0\" align=\"center\" style=\"width:468px;\"> <tbody> <tr> <td valign=\"top\" align=\"left\" style=\"width:530px;\"> <p><strong>Customer Communication</strong></p>\n<p> </p>\n<p>For SAP Business Network Suppliers</p>\n</td> <td valign=\"top\" align=\"right\" style=\"width:140px;\"> </td> </tr> </tbody> </table> </td> </tr> <tr><td style=\"width:600px;\" valign=\"top\" align=\"center\"><p> </p></td></tr> <tr><td style=\"width:600px;\" valign=\"top\" align=\"center\"></td></tr> <tr><td style=\"width:600px;\" valign=\"top\" align=\"center\"><p> </p></td></tr> <tr> <td valign=\"top\" align=\"center\" style=\"width:600px;\"> <table cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" border=\"0\" align=\"center\" style=\"width:468px;\"> <tbody> <tr> <td valign=\"top\" align=\"left\" style=\"width:468px;\"> <span> <div> <div>\n<p><strong>Real-Time Support for Procurement Webcasts</strong></p>\n<p><strong>TLS 1.3 Updates for SAP Ariba, SAP Business Network and SAP Fieldglass</strong></p>\n<p>The SAP Product Engineering support team is excited to announce an important webcast that impacts all users – customers, partners, buyers, suppliers and PMOs. This presentation will provide insights on the suspension of support for weak TLS 1.2 cipher suites and the enablement of support for TLS 1.3 updates coming January 2025! The team will discuss how this impacts customers/partners, the actions required, as well as how to verify and test your TLS changes.</p>\n<p>Kindly join us for one of two English-language sessions that will contain the same content. Please select one of the following links to register for a presentation in accordance to your schedule:</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://event.on24.com/wcc/r/4738276/81A62C72059F1E13B497B0C4E99696BE\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer noopener\" title=\"https://event.on24.com/wcc/r/4738276/81A62C72059F1E13B497B0C4E99696BE\" target=\"_blank\">Click here to register for Session 1 on October 29<sup>th</sup> 10:00am IST / 1:30pm JST / 3:30pm AEDT</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://event.on24.com/wcc/r/4738277/5E3780609A3250C83AEFB5053C581EE1\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer noopener\" title=\"https://event.on24.com/wcc/r/4738277/5E3780609A3250C83AEFB5053C581EE1\" target=\"_blank\">Click here to register for Session 2 on October 29<sup>th</sup> 11:00am EDT / 12:00pm BRT / 3:00pm GMT / 4:00pm CET</a></p>\n<p> </p>\n<p><strong>Who should attend?</strong></p>\n<ul type=\"disc\">\n<li>Customers</li>\n<li>Customer Administrators</li>\n<li>Partners</li>\n<li>Buyers</li>\n<li>Standard Account Suppliers</li>\n<li>Enterprise Account Suppliers</li>\n<li>Fieldglass PMOs</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Thank you,</p>\n<p><strong>SAP Support</strong></p>\n<p>Have you missed a webcast or would like to register for other upcoming webcasts? You may review our <a href=\"https://support.ariba.com/item/view/205022\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer noopener\" title=\"https://support.ariba.com/item/view/205022\" target=\"_blank\">webcast archive page</a> or bookmark our <a href=\"https://support.ariba.com/item/view/203705\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer noopener\" title=\"https://support.ariba.com/item/view/203705\" target=\"_blank\">Product Support - Procurement Webcast Series calendar</a>!</p>\n<p> </p>\n</div>\n</div></span> </td> </tr> </tbody> </table> </td> </tr> <tr><td style=\"width:600px;\" valign=\"top\" align=\"center\"><p> </p></td></tr> <tr><td style=\"width:600px;\" valign=\"top\" align=\"center\"></td></tr> <tr><td style=\"width:600px;\" valign=\"top\" align=\"center\"><p> </p></td></tr>\n\n<tr> <td valign=\"top\" align=\"center\" style=\"padding:10px 0;width:600px;\"> <table cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" border=\"1\" align=\"center\" style=\"width:468px;\"> <thead><tr>\n<th style=\"width:50%;\">Product Name</th>\n<th>Affected Entity</th>\n</tr></thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>SAP Business Network</td>\n<td>SAP Business Network Discovery<br> SAP Business Network for Procurement<br> SAP Business Network for Suppliers<br> SAP Business Network for Supply Chain<br> SAP Integration Suite, managed gateway for spend management and SAP Business Network</td>\n</tr></tbody> </table> </td> </tr> <tr><td style=\"width:600px;\" valign=\"top\" align=\"center\"><p> </p></td></tr> <tr><td style=\"width:600px;\" valign=\"top\" align=\"center\"></td></tr> <tr><td style=\"width:600px;\" valign=\"top\" align=\"center\"><p> </p></td></tr> <tr> <td valign=\"top\" align=\"left\" style=\"width:600px;\"> <table cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" border=\"0\" align=\"center\" style=\"width:468px;\"> <tbody> <tr> <td valign=\"top\" align=\"left\" style=\"width:312px;\"> <p>Let's Run Better Together!<br><strong>Your SAP Team</strong> </p>\n</td>\n\n<td valign=\"top\" align=\"right\" style=\"width:156px;\"> </td> </tr> </tbody> </table> </td> </tr> <tr><td style=\"width:600px;\" valign=\"top\" align=\"center\"><p> </p></td></tr> <tr><td style=\"width:600px;\" valign=\"top\" align=\"center\"></td></tr> <tr><td style=\"width:600px;\" valign=\"top\" align=\"center\"><p> </p></td></tr> </tbody> </table> <center> </center> <table cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" border=\"0\" bgcolor=\"#f7f7f7\" align=\"center\" style=\"width:600px;\"> <tbody> <tr> <td valign=\"top\"> <table cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" border=\"0\" align=\"center\" style=\"width:600px;\"> <tbody> <tr> <td> <p>SAP SE | Dietmar-Hopp-Allee 16 | 69190 Walldorf | Germany<br> <a href=\"http://www.sap.com/\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer noopener\" target=\"_blank\">www.sap.com</a> </p>\n</td> </tr> <tr><td valign=\"top\" align=\"center\" style=\"width:600px;\"><p> </p></td></tr> <tr> <td> <p>This e-mail may contain trade secrets or privileged, undisclosed, or otherwise confidential information. If you have received this e-mail in error, you are hereby notified that any review, copying, or distribution of it is strictly prohibited. Please inform us immediately and destroy the original transmittal. Thank you for your cooperation.<br><br>You have received this notification because your email address, or a group email address that you belong to, is configured in an account on the SAP Business Network. To make changes, please update the Network Service Subscription by selecting settings and notifications within your profile to the top right. If you do not have access to your organization's account, please request assistance from your SAP Business Network Account Administrator or submit a request for assistance via <a href=\"https://support.ariba.com/Help_Center/help\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer noopener\" title=\"https://support.ariba.com/Help_Center/help\" target=\"_blank\">Help Center</a>.<br><br>To ensure you continue to receive SAP related information properly please add SAP CloudSupport Alerts <a href=\"mailto:sapcloudsupport@alerts.ondemand.com\">sapcloudsupport@alerts.ondemand.com</a> to your address book or safe senders list.<br><br><a href=\"https://www.sap.com/corporate/en/legal/copyright.html\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer noopener\" title=\"https://www.sap.com/corporate/en/legal/copyright.html\" target=\"_blank\">Copyright</a> | <a href=\"https://www.sap.com/about/trust-center/agreements/business-network.html\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer noopener\" title=\"https://www.sap.com/about/trust-center/agreements/business-network.html\" target=\"_blank\">Privacy</a> | <a href=\"https://www.sap.com/corporate/en/legal/impressum.html\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer noopener\" title=\"https://www.sap.com/corporate/en/legal/impressum.html\" target=\"_blank\">Legal Disclosure</a><br><br></p>\n</td> </tr> </tbody> </table> </td> </tr> </tbody> </table> </td> </tr> </tbody> </table>",
